sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Q as QStash
    participant D as Dispatch Route
    participant DB as PostgreSQL via Prisma
    participant W as WebUntis
    participant M as Matching
    participant N as Notification State
    participant P as Web Push
    participant SW as Service Worker

    Q->>D: POST /api/internal/push/dispatch
    D->>D: Auth prüfen und Push-Zeitfenster prüfen
    D->>DB: User mit notificationsEnabled, Stundenplan, PushSubscriptions laden
    DB-->>D: Nutzerliste
    D->>D: Ziel-Schultage pro Nutzer bestimmen
    D->>W: Vertretungsdaten pro Zieldatum abrufen
    W-->>D: Rohdaten
    D->>D: processApiResponse normalisiert Zeilen

    loop pro User und Zieldatum
        D->>DB: NotificationState für User/Datum laden
        DB-->>D: vorheriger Fingerprint
        D->>M: findRelevantSubstitutions(substitutions, timetable, date)
        M-->>D: relevante Matches
        D->>N: canonicalizeMatchKeys + buildNotificationFingerprint
        N-->>D: currentFingerprint
        D->>N: resolveNotificationDeltaAction(previous, current, count)
        N-->>D: send / skip / clear
        alt send
            D->>P: sendPushMessage(subscription, payload)
            P->>SW: push event
            SW->>SW: showNotification + broadcast to clients
            D->>DB: NotificationState upsert + NotificationFingerprint createMany
        else skip
            D->>D: unverändert, kein Push
        else clear
            D->>DB: NotificationState löschen
        end
    end

    D-->>Q: JSON Summary
